    "reference": "NCEP/NCAR1981-2010 native2.5degree pressure winds, specific humidity and925hPa geopotential; provenance and units verified with the existing constrained reader. No reference enters model forcing.",
    "comparison": "Three fresh actual coupled runs must reproduce their same-source pilot monthly rainfall and temperature statistics; reference must additionally reproduce all original monthly float32T/P cells. Use same native aggregation, projection Jacobian, terrain/coast/coverage exclusions and Gregorian weights as previous circulation diagnostics. Compare925/850 and q-weighted925-300 winds; partialPW and vertical humidity shape for actual layer states. Fixed ocean/land masks and actual native cell counts, no invented below-ground extrapolation or use of surface-model winds as pressure-resolved observations.",
    "plots": "Show every declared profile, winter/summer geographic vectors on native footprints and full monthly errors. Fixed pressure-weighted925-300 wind diagnostic is a partial column, based on products of monthly means, omitting transient covariance. Do not relabel wind or water differences as causal rainfall errors.",
